# THE CLUSTER RUN'S FIXES, LOCALLY ON TOWN01 (user 2026-11-15: "if possible bring fixes to cluster here").
# = slurm/local_frl_c0actor_privcritic_t01_ar2_keepgoal_nojx.env (lane cost 0.5, goal kept fixed, no spawn
#   inside a junction, actor released at 15,000 -- the run that reached training goal success 0.86-0.92 by
#   175,000 decisions while its explore episodes shrank to ~40 m) with:
#   - EXPLORE_GOAL_DIST_M=200 EXPLORE_ARRIVAL_BONUS=100: +100 and the episode ends when an explore episode
#     is 200 m (straight-line, EXPLORE_DIST_MODE=net) from its start;
#   - FOREIGN_GOAL_EXPLORE=1. WITH ONE TOWN THERE IS NO OTHER TOWN TO DRAW FROM (the local card holds one
#     CARLA server), so the wrapper's fallback applies: an explore episode is shown a goal view of THIS town
#     taken at least WRONG_GOAL_MIN_M from its own goal point. It is not the cluster's other-town image;
#   - from the code (22158af), not from this file: the critic's two new inputs (explore distance as a share
#     of the bonus, route distance to the goal), the steer_agree / steer_gap columns, and goal_m /
#     explore_m / m_per_fault on every [FRL] line.
. "$REPO/slurm/local_frl_c0actor_privcritic_t01_ar2_keepgoal_nojx.env"
export EXPLORE_GOAL_DIST_M=200 EXPLORE_ARRIVAL_BONUS=100
export FOREIGN_GOAL_EXPLORE=1
